        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"52,3"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 2,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Banyak data $n = 40$. Letak $Q_3$ = data ke-$\\frac{3 \\cdot 40}{4} = 30$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{Nilai} & f & F_k \\\\ \\hline 41 - 43 & 4 & 4 \\\\ 44 - 46 & 8 & 12 \\\\ 47 - 49 & 12 & 24 \\\\ 50 - 52 & 10 & 34 \\\\ 53 - 55 & 5 & 39 \\\\ 56 - 58 & 1 & 40 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array}" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Data ke-30 berada di kelas 50–52. Tepi bawah $T_b = 49{,}5$; panjang kelas $p = 3$; $F_k$ sebelum = 24; $f = 10$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "Q_3 = 49{,}5 + 3 \\left( \\dfrac{30 - 24}{10} \\right) = 49{,}5 + 1{,}8 = 51{,}3" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jadi, kuartil atasnya adalah 51,3." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SEDANG"
    },
    {
